          "default": null,
          "description": "Always null on this endpoint, and present so the tutor contract mirrors the analysis one field for field (BL-20260503-06): a client can render the same trace strip against either response without special-casing. The tutor calls the provider chain directly rather than running a LangGraph graph, so there is no checkpointed thread to resume \u2014 and null says exactly that, the same way the analysis response says it when no graph ran.",
